"consent auto-approval, sequential/cascade refusal, owner cancellation, "
"expiration — so the approver-performance analytics count only genuine "
"decisions and measure each approver's own response time (cleared on withdraw"
" and reset-to-draft)."
msgstr ""

#. module: approval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:approval.field_approval_request__date_binding_replayed
